# Implementation notes placement

**Plan briefs**: `notes/implementations/<plan_base>_brief.txt` — same base as `.cursor/plans/NNN_<plan_base>.plan.md`

**Session briefs** (owner-requested only): `notes/sessions/session_*_YYYY-MM-DD.txt`

**Scope loop state**: `notes/implementations/scope_loop_state.json` (from `scope_loop_state.example.json`)

**Scope DAG**: `notes/implementations/scope_dag.json` (from `scope_dag.example.json`)

**Escalation files**: `notes/implementations/<scope>_escalation_<N>.txt`

**Progress checklist**: `notes/implementations/implementaion_progress_checklist.md` — agent edits per `owner-checklist-agent-edits.mdc`

**Format**: Dense, machine-parseable sections per `notes/implementations/readme.txt`
